cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use gpumesh in work that you publish, please cite it as below."
title: gpumesh
abstract: >-
  gpumesh is a pure-Python distributed compute mesh that pools GPUs across
  ordinary machines. A coordinator hands tasks to volunteer workers over HTTP,
  and the @mesh and @accelerate decorators run an existing Python function on
  whichever machine in the mesh has capacity, returning exactly what a local
  call would have returned.
type: software

